14:["$","p",null,{"className":"reading-policy","children":"Idea Reconstruction 是从已知背景出发的推演，不代表作者真实心理过程。Follow-up 是研究提案；相关工作比较不等于已证实 Novelty。教学示例与原文案例在正文中区分。"}]
15:["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Contents · 12 Questions"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"移动端论文目录","children":[["$","a","problem",{"href":"#problem","children":["01"," ","Research Problem & Background"]}],["$","a","prior-work",{"href":"#prior-work","children":["02"," ","Prior Work & Research Gap"]}],["$","a","idea-reconstruction",{"href":"#idea-reconstruction","children":["03"," ","Idea Reconstruction"]}],["$","a","intuition",{"href":"#intuition","children":["04"," ","Core Intuition"]}],["$","a","method",{"href":"#method","children":["05"," ","Method & Worked Example"]}],["$","a","mathematics",{"href":"#mathematics","children":["06"," ","Mathematical Foundations"]}],["$","a","experiments",{"href":"#experiments","children":["07"," ","Experiments & Claims"]}],["$","a","takeaways",{"href":"#takeaways","children":["08"," ","Takeaways"]}],["$","a","assumptions",{"href":"#assumptions","children":["09"," ","Most Fragile Assumption"]}],["$","a","reproduction",{"href":"#reproduction","children":["10"," ","One-Week Reproduction"]}],["$","a","counterexample",{"href":"#counterexample","children":["11"," ","Counterexample Design"]}],["$","a","follow-up",{"href":"#follow-up","children":["12"," ","Follow-up Research"]}]]}]]}]
16:["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-sections","children":[["$","section","problem",{"id":"problem","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Research Problem & Background"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"问题为什么重要，解决它有什么价值？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"依靠题目和正确答案训练 reasoning，会把自学习限制在已有标注任务中。论文研究普通文本能否提供足够的监督，让 model 自己提出中间解释，再根据这些解释是否有助于预测后文来学习，而不需要逐条标注思维过程。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Quiet-STaR: Language Models Can Teach Themselves to Think Before Speaking · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"普通文本包含大量未写出的中间推理，逐条标注不现实。Quiet-STaR 研究能否在一般文本的不同位置生成潜在 Rationale，用后续文本的可预测性训练有帮助的思考。它将 Reasoning 学习从有明确答案的题库扩展到语言建模。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Quiet-STaR: Language Models Can Teach Themselves to Think Before Speaking · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","prior-work",{"id":"prior-work","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prior Work & Research Gap"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"前人做到哪一步，缺口在哪里？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-prior","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-prior","children":"Prior Work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"STaR 通过最终答案筛选 Rationale，需要问题与正确答案。Quiet-STaR 利用文本本来就有的后续 Token 作为信号，学习哪些潜在思考改善预测，并处理并行生成、思考初始化和未来多 Token 评分等困难。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2203.14465",{"href":"#reference-2203.14465","aria-label":"来源 2: STaR: Bootstrapping Reasoning With Reasoning","children":["[",2,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","idea-reconstruction",{"id":"idea-reconstruction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Idea Reconstruction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从已有知识与失败模式出发，如何走到这个想法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"在读一句话时，人会推断省略的原因、意图或中间计算；这些推断通常能帮助预期下文。若一段内部文字让 Model 更好预测真实后续文本，就可把它视为候选有用思考。初始思考可能很差，所以需要一种平滑机制保留原有预测能力，再逐步学习何时使用思考。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2203.14465",{"href":"#reference-2203.14465","aria-label":"来源 2: STaR: Bootstrapping Reasoning With Reasoning","children":["[",2,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","intuition",{"id":"intuition","children":[[["$","span","insight",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"insight"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"04"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Core Intuition"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一个清楚的视角抓住方法本质。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"中间 reasoning 是否有用，可以通过它改变后续文本概率的效果来衡量。这样，未写出的解释成为可学习的隐变量，监督来自真实后文；重点是学会产生对预测有帮助的 reasoning，而非要求 reasoning 文本模仿人工标准答案。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Quiet-STaR: Language Models Can Teach Themselves to Think Before Speaking · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":["$L1b","$L1c","$undefined","$L1d"]}],"$L1e"]]}]]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25"]}]
